    "Scan of the 1982 edition of the Lambs Corner, North Carolina, topographic map at 1:24,000 scale (7.5 x 7.5 minute series), published by the U.S. Geological Survey. Surveyed in 1980; aerial photographs from 1975; field checked in 1977; last revised in 1982; printed in 1983.",
    "Variations: woodland tint, orthophotomap. Sheet size: 21.9 x 26.7 inches. Printed projection: Lambert Conformal Conic; horizontal datum: NAD27. From the USGS Historical Topographic Map Collection."
